    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Game Dev - A plan]]></title>
        <id>http://learn.wangnelson.xyz/blog/2022/6/9/game-dev</id>
        <link href="http://learn.wangnelson.xyz/blog/2022/6/9/game-dev"/>
        <updated>2022-06-09T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[I am planning to start hte game dev. But my major question is what game engine?]]></summary>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<div class="theme-admonition theme-admonition-note admonition_xJq3 alert alert--secondary"><div class="admonitionHeading_Gvgb"><span class="admonitionIcon_Rf37"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 16"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M6.3 5.69a.942.942 0 0 1-.28-.7c0-.28.09-.52.28-.7.19-.18.42-.28.7-.28.28 0 .52.09.7.28.18.19.28.42.28.7 0 .28-.09.52-.28.7a1 1 0 0 1-.7.3c-.28 0-.52-.11-.7-.3zM8 7.99c-.02-.25-.11-.48-.31-.69-.2-.19-.42-.3-.69-.31H6c-.27.02-.48.13-.69.31-.2.2-.3.44-.31.69h1v3c.02.27.11.5.31.69.2.2.42.31.69.31h1c.27 0 .48-.11.69-.31.2-.19.3-.42.31-.69H8V7.98v.01zM7 2.3c-3.14 0-5.7 2.54-5.7 5.68 0 3.14 2.56 5.7 5.7 5.7s5.7-2.55 5.7-5.7c0-3.15-2.56-5.69-5.7-5.69v.01zM7 .98c3.86 0 7 3.14 7 7s-3.14 7-7 7-7-3.12-7-7 3.14-7 7-7z"></path></svg></span>Start</div><div class="admonitionContent_BuS1"><p>I am planning to start hte game dev. But my major question is what game engine?</p><iframe width="100%" height="300" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/UPYYHTjw-fY" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen="true"></iframe></div></div>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="checking-into-different-game-engines">Checking into different game engines.<a href="http://learn.wangnelson.xyz/blog/2022/6/9/game-dev#checking-into-different-game-engines" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Checking into different game engines." title="Direct link to Checking into different game engines.">​</a></h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Metric</th><th>Phaser</th><th>Unity</th><th>Gamemaker Studio 2</th><th>Godot</th><th>Unreal Engine</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Learning Difficulty</td><td>6</td><td>7</td><td>2</td><td>4</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>Mobile Platform</td><td>3</td><td>9</td><td>9</td><td>?</td><td>8</td></tr><tr><td>Web Platform</td><td>10</td><td>8</td><td>8</td><td>8</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>Scalability</td><td>2</td><td>9</td><td>4</td><td>6</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>Cheap</td><td>10</td><td>8</td><td>1</td><td>10</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>Loading Speed</td><td>6</td><td>2</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Language Usefullness</td><td>8</td><td>8</td><td>2</td><td>1</td><td>7</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="escalability">Escalability<a href="http://learn.wangnelson.xyz/blog/2022/6/9/game-dev#escalability" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Escalability" title="Direct link to Escalability">​</a></h3>
<p>This means how good are they at scaling up.</p>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="out-of-the-question">Out of the question<a href="http://learn.wangnelson.xyz/blog/2022/6/9/game-dev#out-of-the-question" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Out of the question" title="Direct link to Out of the question">​</a></h3>
<ul>
<li>3djs -&gt; Too complex for your first game engine</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="gamemaker-studio-2---for-first-game-engine">Gamemaker Studio 2 - For first game engine<a href="http://learn.wangnelson.xyz/blog/2022/6/9/game-dev#gamemaker-studio-2---for-first-game-engine" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Gamemaker Studio 2 - For first game engine" title="Direct link to Gamemaker Studio 2 - For first game engine">​</a></h2>
<div class="theme-admonition theme-admonition-caution admonition_xJq3 alert alert--warning"><div class="admonitionHeading_Gvgb"><span class="admonitionIcon_Rf37"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M8.893 1.5c-.183-.31-.52-.5-.887-.5s-.703.19-.886.5L.138 13.499a.98.98 0 0 0 0 1.001c.193.31.53.501.886.501h13.964c.367 0 .704-.19.877-.5a1.03 1.03 0 0 0 .01-1.002L8.893 1.5zm.133 11.497H6.987v-2.003h2.039v2.003zm0-3.004H6.987V5.987h2.039v4.006z"></path></svg></span>There is a catch!</div><div class="admonitionContent_BuS1"><p>It is free to develop games, you have to pay for exporting it (Sharing to friends)</p><p><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="http://learn.wangnelson.xyz/assets/images/2022-06-09-14-50-56-a9a48be13c4cacb7916ab35f637bb126.png" width="1367" height="714" class="img_ev3q"></p><p><strong>However</strong></p><ul>
<li>As an instructor I can buy and export the games for you and just send you the files or publish them for you</li>
<li>Of course I will not take any credits/profit form your game</li>
</ul></div></div>
<div class="theme-admonition theme-admonition-note admonition_xJq3 alert alert--secondary"><div class="admonitionHeading_Gvgb"><span class="admonitionIcon_Rf37"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 16"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M6.3 5.69a.942.942 0 0 1-.28-.7c0-.28.09-.52.28-.7.19-.18.42-.28.7-.28.28 0 .52.09.7.28.18.19.28.42.28.7 0 .28-.09.52-.28.7a1 1 0 0 1-.7.3c-.28 0-.52-.11-.7-.3zM8 7.99c-.02-.25-.11-.48-.31-.69-.2-.19-.42-.3-.69-.31H6c-.27.02-.48.13-.69.31-.2.2-.3.44-.31.69h1v3c.02.27.11.5.31.69.2.2.42.31.69.31h1c.27 0 .48-.11.69-.31.2-.19.3-.42.31-.69H8V7.98v.01zM7 2.3c-3.14 0-5.7 2.54-5.7 5.68 0 3.14 2.56 5.7 5.7 5.7s5.7-2.55 5.7-5.7c0-3.15-2.56-5.69-5.7-5.69v.01zM7 .98c3.86 0 7 3.14 7 7s-3.14 7-7 7-7-3.12-7-7 3.14-7 7-7z"></path></svg></span>Why GameMaker Studio 2</div><div class="admonitionContent_BuS1"><ul>
<li>Easy to learn</li>
<li>Decent Scalability</li>
<li>Compatibility with all type of platforms: Web browsers, Mobile Applications,</li>
</ul><p><strong>Showcase</strong></p><iframe width="100%" height="1000" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/FCJn91Cc7GY" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen="true"></iframe></div></div>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="subscription-comparison">Subscription Comparison<a href="http://learn.wangnelson.xyz/blog/2022/6/9/game-dev#subscription-comparison" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Subscription Comparison" title="Direct link to Subscription Comparison">​</a></h3>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="phaser---for-fast-loading-games-totally-free">Phaser - For fast loading games (Totally Free)<a href="http://learn.wangnelson.xyz/blog/2022/6/9/game-dev#phaser---for-fast-loading-games-totally-free" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Phaser - For fast loading games (Totally Free)" title="Direct link to Phaser - For fast loading games (Totally Free)">​</a></h2>
<div class="theme-admonition theme-admonition-note admonition_xJq3 alert alert--secondary"><div class="admonitionHeading_Gvgb"><span class="admonitionIcon_Rf37"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 16"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M6.3 5.69a.942.942 0 0 1-.28-.7c0-.28.09-.52.28-.7.19-.18.42-.28.7-.28.28 0 .52.09.7.28.18.19.28.42.28.7 0 .28-.09.52-.28.7a1 1 0 0 1-.7.3c-.28 0-.52-.11-.7-.3zM8 7.99c-.02-.25-.11-.48-.31-.69-.2-.19-.42-.3-.69-.31H6c-.27.02-.48.13-.69.31-.2.2-.3.44-.31.69h1v3c.02.27.11.5.31.69.2.2.42.31.69.31h1c.27 0 .48-.11.69-.31.2-.19.3-.42.31-.69H8V7.98v.01zM7 2.3c-3.14 0-5.7 2.54-5.7 5.68 0 3.14 2.56 5.7 5.7 5.7s5.7-2.55 5.7-5.7c0-3.15-2.56-5.69-5.7-5.69v.01zM7 .98c3.86 0 7 3.14 7 7s-3.14 7-7 7-7-3.12-7-7 3.14-7 7-7z"></path></svg></span>Why Phaser</div><div class="admonitionContent_BuS1"><ul>
<li>Fast Loading</li>
</ul></div></div>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="phasergodot--best-for-chromebook">Phaser/Godot- Best for Chromebook<a href="http://learn.wangnelson.xyz/blog/2022/6/9/game-dev#phasergodot--best-for-chromebook" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Phaser/Godot- Best for Chromebook" title="Direct link to Phaser/Godot- Best for Chromebook">​</a></h2>
<p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=J5z1Z3DUbNs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Game Development on Chromebook with Godot</a></p>
<p>While the case for Phaser is that it just needs a linux terminal + a programming field and that should be enough since it just needs a browser for loading it.</p>
<p><strong>Showcase</strong></p>
<iframe width="100%" height="528" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/R4e-u1i3Nt8" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen="true"></iframe>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="unity---best-for-serious-game-dev">Unity - Best for Serious Game Dev<a href="http://learn.wangnelson.xyz/blog/2022/6/9/game-dev#unity---best-for-serious-game-dev" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Unity - Best for Serious Game Dev" title="Direct link to Unity - Best for Serious Game Dev">​</a></h2>
<iframe width="100%" height="528" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/na7EMenl2lY" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen="true"></iframe>
<div class="theme-admonition theme-admonition-note admonition_xJq3 alert alert--secondary"><div class="admonitionHeading_Gvgb"><span class="admonitionIcon_Rf37"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 16"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M6.3 5.69a.942.942 0 0 1-.28-.7c0-.28.09-.52.28-.7.19-.18.42-.28.7-.28.28 0 .52.09.7.28.18.19.28.42.28.7 0 .28-.09.52-.28.7a1 1 0 0 1-.7.3c-.28 0-.52-.11-.7-.3zM8 7.99c-.02-.25-.11-.48-.31-.69-.2-.19-.42-.3-.69-.31H6c-.27.02-.48.13-.69.31-.2.2-.3.44-.31.69h1v3c.02.27.11.5.31.69.2.2.42.31.69.31h1c.27 0 .48-.11.69-.31.2-.19.3-.42.31-.69H8V7.98v.01zM7 2.3c-3.14 0-5.7 2.54-5.7 5.68 0 3.14 2.56 5.7 5.7 5.7s5.7-2.55 5.7-5.7c0-3.15-2.56-5.69-5.7-5.69v.01zM7 .98c3.86 0 7 3.14 7 7s-3.14 7-7 7-7-3.12-7-7 3.14-7 7-7z"></path></svg></span>Reasons</div><div class="admonitionContent_BuS1"><p><strong>Pros</strong></p><ul>
<li>Allows 3D/2D</li>
<li>Crossplatform Compatible</li>
<li>Reasonable Difficulty</li>
<li>Online Multiplayer</li>
</ul><p><strong>Cons</strong></p><ul>
<li>Loading Speed</li>
</ul></div></div>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="study-plan">Study Plan<a href="http://learn.wangnelson.xyz/blog/2022/6/9/game-dev#study-plan" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Study Plan" title="Direct link to Study Plan">​</a></h2>]]></content>
